{'symbol': 'MET', 'date': '2023-01-31 15:16:00', 'title': 'METLIFE HONORED AS A MEMBER OF THE 2023 BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--METLIFE, INC. (NYSE: MET) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FOR THE EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE BLOOMBERG GENDER-EQUALITY INDEX (GEI), WHICH TRACKS THE PERFORMANCE OF PUBLIC COMPANIES THAT REPORT GENDER-RELATED DATA.'}